# DamSafe Twin — frontend environment (copy to .env for local dev)
# All keys are OPTIONAL. The app starts keyless (Esri satellite + OSM fallback).

# Backend API base (empty = same origin / Vite dev proxy to localhost:8000)
# Deploy note: scheme + host ONLY — never add /api/v1 or a trailing slash;
# the code appends /api/v1 to every path itself (double prefix → 404s).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Cesium ion token → OPTIONAL. Real 3D terrain now works KEYLESS via Esri
# World Elevation, so you do NOT need this on Vercel (Vercel flags VITE_*
# secrets, correctly — anything VITE_* ships in the public JS bundle).
# It only unlocks the "ion" photorealistic basemap stack in God's Eye 3D
# for local dev. Free Community plan = eligible personal, non-commercial
# use with quotas. Get one at https://cesium.com/ion (public assets:read).
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
